# AWS Infrastructure Portfolio Project

Production-grade infrastructure project built with Infrastructure as Code (IaC) principles for SRE/Cloud engineering demonstration.

## 🏗️ Architecture & Stack
- Cloud Provider: AWS (Region: ap-northeast-1 / Tokyo)
- Provisioning Tool: Terraform
- Compute: EC2 (`t3.micro` - Free Tier eligible)
- OS: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS
- Networking: Custom VPC, Public/Private Subnets, Internet Gateway, Security Groups

## 🚀 Pipeline & Stages
1. Infrastructure as Code: Automated provisioning of networking and compute layers via Terraform.
2. Security: Implementation of least-privilege access rules through Security Groups.
3. OS Provisioning & Configuration: Automated environment setup.
4. CI/CD & Monitoring: (In progress) Automated deployment pipelines and observability.

## 📂 Repository Structure
- main.tf — Main Terraform configuration (Provider, VPC, Subnets, Security Groups, EC2 instance).
